  "title": {
    "zh": "飞轮口令盘",
    "en": "Flywheel Code Wheel"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "连续三次滚动校验",
    "en": "Three linked checksum readings"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "回收 rotor、brake、shaft 并到出口。校验单按这三个名称的顺序处理。码从 seed 开始，每次用（旧码 × 2 ＋ 本件 marks 读数）除以 31 的余数作新码。按顺序提交从内存读到的三个新码，并把最终码留在地址 0。 限 37 回合，避开巡逻。scan() 列出巡线、目标坐标和 compass 方向表。第二张地图将图纸旋转半圈。",
    "en": "Recover rotor, brake and shaft and reach the exit. The checksum manifest lists the parts in that order. Start at seed and use the remainder of (old code × 2 + the part’s marks reading) divided by 31 as each new code. Submit the three codes in manifest order from memory reads and leave the final code at address 0. Avoid patrols within 37 turns. scan() lists patrol cycles, goal locations and the compass for plan directions. The second map rotates the plan by 180 degrees."
  },
